> diff sin(x: real)
d/dx sin(x) = cos(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-15)
> diff cos(x: real)
d/dx cos(x) = -sin(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)
> diff tan(x: real)
d/dx tan(x) = 1/cos(x)^2
  holds for cos(x) != 0
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 4e-07)
> diff sec(x: real)
d/dx sec(x) = tan(x)*sec(x)
  holds for cos(x) != 0
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 4e-07)
> diff csc(x: real)
d/dx csc(x) = -csc(x)*cot(x)
  holds for sin(x) != 0
  check: matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 3e-06)
> diff cot(x: real)
d/dx cot(x) = -1/sin(x)^2
  holds for sin(x) != 0
  check: matches central differences at 200 points (max relative difference 3e-06)
> diff asin(x: real)
d/dx asin(x) = 1/sqrt(1 - x^2)
  holds for 1 - x^2 >= 0 and x != -1 and x != 1
    at x = -1 (an end of the domain) asin(x) has an infinite one-sided slope
    at x = 1 (an end of the domain) asin(x) has an infinite one-sided slope
    (points looked for in [-10, 10])
  check: matches central differences at 20 points (max relative difference 6e-13)
> diff acos(x: real)
d/dx acos(x) = -1/sqrt(1 - x^2)
  holds for 1 - x^2 >= 0 and x != -1 and x != 1
    at x = -1 (an end of the domain) acos(x) has an infinite one-sided slope
    at x = 1 (an end of the domain) acos(x) has an infinite one-sided slope
    (points looked for in [-10, 10])
  check: matches central differences at 20 points (max relative difference 6e-13)
> diff atan(x: real)
d/dx atan(x) = 1/(x^2 + 1)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 8e-16)
> diff sinh(x: real)
d/dx sinh(x) = cosh(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-15)
> diff cosh(x: real)
d/dx cosh(x) = sinh(x)
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 3e-15)
> diff tanh(x: real)
d/dx tanh(x) = 1/cosh(x)^2
  holds for every real x
  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 1e-15)
